      en: "The Holetown Monument in Barbados marks the landing site of the first English settlers in 1625 led by Captain John Powell. Erected in 1925 for the 300th anniversary, the coral stone obelisk stands in Holetown on the west coast. It commemorates the start of British colonization. Annual ceremonies are held at the site.",
